{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "边边的诚意与仗义  (Bianbian's Unexpected Gesture of Loyalty)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right as Xingtian's executives vote on appointing Chun Yuqiao chief content officer, a flashback reveals what reporter Bianbian actually did with Bu Xiaogu's secret when he visited Stella. Listen to Bianbian, Stella, and Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉，布小谷身上的秘密我可都知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你在说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "是你们公关部自己走漏了风声，才让我有了线索。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这件事情今天已经有了官方结论。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "如果再传出别的版本让外界和电视台知道，是不是你们公关部的重大失败？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你少胡说八道，你到底想怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我也没什么别的要求，就是请你看准机会，帮某人一个忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "凯文哥，上回跟你说要表达一下我的诚意，其实你没明白我的意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "解决那两个嘉宾的事根本不算什么，真正重要的是斯戴拉这一票。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我跟你们公司的布小谷聊了一次天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "通过她对淳于总的忠心，我明白了一些事情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我边边虽然不是特别仗义的人，但是我想和真仗义的人交朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好兄弟，这份人情我们记下了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉，布小谷身上的秘密我可都知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stella, I now know all about the secret surrounding Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你在说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you talking about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "是你们公关部自己走漏了风声，才让我有了线索。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your own PR department let word slip, which gave me the trail.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这件事情今天已经有了官方结论。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That incident already has an official conclusion today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "如果再传出别的版本让外界和电视台知道，是不是你们公关部的重大失败？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If another version leaks to the public and the network, would that not be a major PR failure for you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你少胡说八道，你到底想怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop talking nonsense — what exactly do you want?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我也没什么别的要求，就是请你看准机会，帮某人一个忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have no other demand — just watch for the right moment and do someone a favour.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "凯文哥，上回跟你说要表达一下我的诚意，其实你没明白我的意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen, last time I mentioned showing my sincerity, you did not catch my full meaning.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "解决那两个嘉宾的事根本不算什么，真正重要的是斯戴拉这一票。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorting out those two commentators was nothing; what truly counts is Stella's vote.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我跟你们公司的布小谷聊了一次天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I had a conversation with Bu Xiaogu from your company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "通过她对淳于总的忠心，我明白了一些事情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seeing her loyalty toward Mr Chun Yuqiao made several things clear to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我边边虽然不是特别仗义的人，但是我想和真仗义的人交朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I may not be the most chivalrous guy myself, yet I want to be friends with truly loyal people.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好兄弟，这份人情我们记下了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good brother, we will remember this favour!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉，布小谷身上的秘密我可都知道了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你在说什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "是你们公关部自己走漏了风声，才让我有了线索。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这件事情今天已经有了官方结论。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "如果再传出别的版本让外界和电视台知道，是不是你们公关部的重大失败？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你少胡说八道，你到底想怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我也没什么别的要求，就是请你看准机会，帮某人一个忙。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "凯文哥，上回跟你说要表达一下我的诚意，其实你没明白我的意思。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "解决那两个嘉宾的事根本不算什么，真正重要的是斯戴拉这一票。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我跟你们公司的布小谷聊了一次天。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "通过她对淳于总的忠心，我明白了一些事情。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我边边虽然不是特别仗义的人，但是我想和真仗义的人交朋友。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好兄弟，这份人情我们记下了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moved by Xiaogu's loyalty, Bianbian turned the tables on Stella to secure PR's crucial vote for Chun Yuqiao. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
